# format=FAST
# Fusion MS-WB670 at source 51. Live bus, 2026-09-18.
#
# FUSION_SETTING id 7 "Tuner Region" value semantics. The operator read each
# region name off the Fusion iOS app while changing it, so every value below is
# observed against a name rather than inferred:
#
#   0 = USA        1 = Europe        2 = Japan        3 = Australasia
#
# First frame: a full 130820 "Settings" list carrying id 7 = 1, captured while
# the app displayed "Europe". Remaining frames: single 130820 "Setting"
# updates, one per change the operator made (Japan, Australasia, USA,
# Australasia).
#
# Each region change also emits 30 further "Setting" messages, one per AM and
# FM preset, all with value 0 -- the region change resets the preset bank
# unconditionally, including when the presets are already empty (three of the
# four changes here had nothing left to clear). That is the same per-preset
# clear mechanism documented for "Delete All" in #879, reached by an unrelated
# trigger, which rules out its being an artifact of that menu action.
#
